            "title": "Development test dates",
            "body": "This tracker test runs November 1\u201316, 2026, from 08:00 UTC to 08:00 UTC, alongside the development Hammer Jam event. The reference image is labeled October 2026; these are test dates, not an announcement of an official event."
          },
          {
            "title": "Exact per-level adjustments",
            "body": "Each listed target cost and time is calculated against the bundled Supercharge data. The image\u2019s rounded reduction percentages are not used as blanket discounts. Values below are before Gold Pass. Gold Pass multiplies with these factors. Hammer Jam excludes Supercharges, so its 50% factor does not additionally reduce these upgrades. Regular upgrades and buildings not listed here, including Inferno Tower and Monolith, receive no Supercharge discount from this event."
          },
          {
